  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Quiver_items\" title=\"Category:Quiver items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_Item_Slot_Quiver.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quivering_Quiver\">Quivering Quiver</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"border-color-1\" style=\"clear: right; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #EEBBEE; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#FFC2FF;--bg-color-2-dark:#4B224B;--border-color-1:#DDA0DD;--border-color-1-dark:#773777;\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"50%\">None\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#F0E4F0\" width=\"35%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Quiver_Generic_Quivering.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Quiver_Generic_Quivering.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">Quiver / Wide Quiver\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a>:</b> There is no material defined for this item.  Quivers and cosmetic/store items have no listed material.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"450\">500 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">1.00 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #EEBBEE\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #F0E4F0\"><b><a href=\"/page/Harbinger_of_Madness\" title=\"Harbinger of Madness\">Harbinger of Madness</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Unique item capacity\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>10\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Max stack size\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>300\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Arrow_Spitting\" title=\"Arrow Spitting\">Arrow Spitting</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Arrow_Spitting\" title=\"Arrow Spitting\">Arrow Spitting</a>:</b> While this item is equipped and an enemy hits you, there is a chance that this item will produce a stack of 20 arrows of a random type. Where exactly the arrows come from remains a mystery.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Quivering_Quiver.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Quivering_Quiver.png/420px-Quivering_Quiver.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"332\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Quivering_Quiver.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><i>This quiver is completely organic, and is rough and slimy to the touch. It shivers periodically, and when provoked it will sometimes disgorge arrows of a random type. Try not to think about where they've been. The quiver will also hold 10 different types of arrow or bolt and can store each type in a stack of up to 300. Total capacity: 3000.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">Randomly produces stacks of 20 arrows (never bolts) of the following if you are hit:\n<ul><li>+1 Xoriat <a href=\"/page/Lawful_Outsider\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lawful Outsider\">Lawbane</a> Arrows - <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Lawful Outsider Bane</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Lawful Outsider Bane</a>:</b> A bane weapon excels at attacking one type or subtype of creature. Against Lawful Outsiders, this weapon's effective enhancement bonus is +2 better than its normal enhancement bonus. It deals an extra 2 to 12 points of damage against the foe.</span></span>, ML:2</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat Arrows - ML:4</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cold_Iron\" title=\"Cold Iron\">Cold Iron</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cold_Iron\" title=\"Cold Iron\">Cold Iron</a>:</b> This iron mined deep underground, known for its effectiveness against fey creatures, is forged at a lower temperature to preserve its delicate properties. When combined with <a href=\"/page/Good_aligned\" title=\"Good aligned\">Good</a> damage types, Cold Iron weapons are able to overcome the <a href=\"/page/Damage_reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage reduction\">damage reduction</a> of most <a href=\"/page/Demon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Demon\">Demons</a> like <a href=\"/page/Fire_Reaver\" title=\"Fire Reaver\">Fire Reavers</a> or <a href=\"/page/Flesh_Render\" title=\"Flesh Render\">Flesh Renders</a>. See <a href=\"/page/Monster_DR_and_weaknesses\" title=\"Monster DR and weaknesses\">Monster DR and weaknesses</a> for specifics.</span></span>   Arrows - ML:4</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Weapons made of adamantine have the ability to bypass the protective damage reduction of certain monsters.</span></span>   Arrows - ML:4</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">Silver</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Silver\" title=\"Silver\">Silver</a>:</b> A complex process involving metallurgy and alchemy can bond <b>silver</b> to a <u>weapon made of steel</u> so that it bypasses the damage reduction of creatures such as devils and vampires. <br /> Silver weapons have 2 points lower hardness then equivalent steel weapons, and as such aren't quite as durable.</span></span>   Arrows - ML:4</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <a href=\"/page/Corrosive\" title=\"Corrosive\">Corrosive</a> Arrows - <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Acid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Acid\">Acid</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Acid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Acid\">Acid</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in corrosive acid. An acid weapon deals an extra 1 to 6 points of acid damage on a successful hit.</span></span>, ML:6</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Flaming#Flaming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flaming\">Flaming</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Flaming#Flaming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flaming\">Flaming</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in fire. A flaming weapon deals an extra 1 to 6 points of fire damage on a successful hit.</span></span> Arrows - ML:6</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Frost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Frost\">Frost</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Frost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Frost\">Frost</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in icy cold. A frost weapon deals an extra 1 to 6 points of cold damage on a successful hit.</span></span> Arrows - ML:6</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shock\">Shock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shock\">Shock</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in crackling electricity. A shock weapon deals an extra 1 to 6 points of electricity damage on a successful hit.</span></span> Arrows - ML:6</li>\n<li>+3 Xoriat <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Anarchic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alignment_damage_(weapon)#Anarchic\" title=\"Alignment damage (weapon)\">Anarchic</a>:</b> An anarchic weapon is chaotically aligned and infused with the power of chaos. It makes the weapon chaos-aligned and thus bypasses the corresponding damage reduction. It deals an extra 2 to 12 damage against all of <a href=\"/page/Lawful\" title=\"Lawful\">lawful</a> alignment.</span></span> Arrows - ML:8</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817031622\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.174 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5968/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43040/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18243/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 25/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.22%  151.426     74 Template:IO\n100.00%  151.098      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  151.098      1 -total\n 96.42%  145.696      1 Template:Quiver\n 33.68%   50.889      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 32.37%   48.910      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 31.33%   47.343      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 30.53%   46.135      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.20%   33.542     11 Template:Popup\n 19.52%   29.489      4 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14505-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817031622 and revision id 634101. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
